{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 16, :comments ["<b>And her priests</b> — for they don priestly garments. Perhaps they are garments of righteousness; He will clothe them with garments of salvation, in the manner of: \"He has clothed me with garments of salvation\" — so that salvation will be publicized and visible upon them like a garment." "<b>And her faithful ones</b> — they are the Levites."], :book :psalms, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 132, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Psalms -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/tehilim"] ["Wikisource Mikraot Gedolot" "http://en.wikisource.org/wiki/Mikraot_Gedolot/"] ["Tanakh, Venice, 1617-1619" "https://dlib.rsl.ru/viewer/01007514045#?page=4"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:41:37.871766173Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}